<title>USA: Wall Street Deli sees Q4 charge.</title>
<headline>Wall Street Deli sees Q4 charge.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street Deli Inc said it expects to take a fourth quarter charge of about $575,000 due to the planned closing of its Memphis administrative office in June.</p>
<p>Wall Street Deli said it is consolidating operations and administrative staffs in Birmingham, Ala..</p>
<p>The company said the charge will cover the office closing as well as severance and transitional costs, and relocation costs of certain key personnel.</p>
</text>
